t in Parliament so  without clear leadership there will be a  sense that these groups could try and  assert their own power over one another  and this is something that had happened  in the past and this was certainly a  lorry of many amulets and smoke stood  here for the past few weeks that the  this uncertainty just creates that kind  of vacuum for these issues to play  themselves out and that is what the  president was trying to avoid and even  the Grand Ayatollah Sistani had  mentioned that this is something that  should be avoided we cannot have this  kind of power of vacuum in the country  because it creates such security  instability in this country so this is  why they were trying to find the  candidate but they failed clearly so now  this is something that will be very very  important for the security apparatuses  because also according to the  Constitution the Prime Minister is the  commander-in-chief of the armed forces  in the country so we the caretaker Prime  Minister he still technically available  make me in charge of the country's  security forces now with the president's  resignation we don't know how he will  move forward what his next move will be  as well it could be enough of truly for  him to use to stay off until they can  hold elections in Iraq well of course  we'll continue to monitor events there  are more stamens that are coming out of  the Iraqi capital as the day progresses  for the moment dose of Jabari they are  correspondent in Baghdad thank you

